      "data": {
        "name": "Crystal Negotiates",
        "prompt": "Hi {{first_name}}, this is **Crystal**, your Senior Recruiter at Bland.ai — great to connect!\nYou mentioned expecting around ${{salary}}/yr — totally fair for your level. Our **top OTE** for this role is **$500k** (base + bonus + equity), and it’s a strong package with fast growth.\n**Does $500k work for you?** *(Just say “yes” or “no” — or let me know what you’re thinking!)*",
